{"seq":2,"slug":"cni-plugins-dataplane-overlay","title":"CNI 插件与数据面实现：bridge/overlay(VXLAN/IPIP)/BGP 与路由模式选型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-cni-cilium-ebpf-dataplane-service-routing/pod-network-cni-model/cni-plugins-dataplane-overlay","wordCount":2551,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"cni-插件与数据面实现-bridge-overlay-vxlan-ipip-bgp-与路由模式选型\">CNI 插件与数据面实现：bridge/overlay(VXLAN/IPIP)/BGP 与路由模式选型</h1><p>两个 Pod 分属不同节点、各落在互不相邻的 Pod CIDR 里，它们之间那条 TCP 连接经过几层转发、有没有封装头、在哪一层被决定——都不是 Kubernetes 决定的，而是 CNI 插件选定的<strong>数据面模式</strong>决定的。同一个集群换成 VXLAN 隧道还是 BGP 原生路由，MTU 上限、故障征状、安全边界可见性都不同；对跨中国区与海外 region 的跨境电商集群，这还直接决定抓包时看到的是 Pod IP 还是节点 IP。本章总览见 <a href=\"./\">本章索引</a>，Service 层转发替换见 <a href=\"../service-dataplane-kube-proxy-replacement/\">Service 数据面与 kube-proxy 替换</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-cni-契约只定接口-数据面模式定转发\">核心概念：CNI 契约只定接口，数据面模式定转发</h2><p>CNI（Container Network Interface）是<strong>接口规范</strong>而非实现：它规定可执行文件响应哪些动词、以什么格式读配置、把结果写到 stdout 的哪个结构。当前稳定版本是 CNI spec 1.0/1.1（<code>github.com/containernetworking/cni</code>；1.1.0 在 <code>ADD</code>/<code>DEL</code>/<code>CHECK</code> 之外加入 <code>GC</code> 与 <code>STATUS</code>，用于回收遗漏的 IPAM 分配）。规范里<strong>没有</strong>任何关于封装、路由协议或 MTU 的要求——这些全是实现自由度。</p>\n<p>一个 CNI 插件实际承担三件事：<strong>IPAM</strong>（分配 IP，<code>host-local</code> 从节点 CIDR 切片取，云 ENI 模式从 VPC 子网借）、<strong>接入</strong>（把 netns 接进主机网络栈，用一对 veth）、<strong>跨节点转发</strong>（目标在别的节点时包怎么走）。第三条才是数据面模式的战场。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Pod eth0&lt;br/&gt;10.244.1.5&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;veth pair&lt;br/&gt;Pod ↔ host netns&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;主机网桥 cni0&lt;br/&gt;L2 转发&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;同节点&quot;| D[&quot;对端 Pod 的 veth&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;跨节点&quot;| E{&quot;跨节点出口选型&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;overlay&quot;| F[&quot;VXLAN / IPIP 封装&lt;br/&gt;外层走 underlay IP&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;原生路由&quot;| G[&quot;节点路由表&lt;br/&gt;按 Pod CIDR 查下一跳&quot;]&#10;    F --&gt; H[&quot;对端解封装 → 内层包&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; I[&quot;对端直接收包&lt;br/&gt;无封装开销&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Pod eth0&lt;br/&gt;10.244.1.5\"] --&gt; B[\"veth pair&lt;br/&gt;Pod ↔ host netns\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"主机网桥 cni0&lt;br/&gt;L2 转发\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"同节点\"| D[\"对端 Pod 的 veth\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"跨节点\"| E{\"跨节点出口选型\"}\n    E --&gt;|\"overlay\"| F[\"VXLAN / IPIP 封装&lt;br/&gt;外层走 underlay IP\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"原生路由\"| G[\"节点路由表&lt;br/&gt;按 Pod CIDR 查下一跳\"]\n    F --&gt; H[\"对端解封装 → 内层包\"]\n    G --&gt; I[\"对端直接收包&lt;br/&gt;无封装开销\"]</pre><p>跨节点转发的四种主流做法，代价结构完全不同：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>跨节点模式</th>\n<th>封装开销</th>\n<th>对 underlay 的要求</th>\n<th>典型实现</th>\n<th>主要代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>纯 L2 直连 / host-gw</td>\n<td>0 字节</td>\n<td>所有节点同 L2 网段</td>\n<td>Flannel <code>host-gw</code>、Calico 无封装</td>\n<td>无法跨三层子网，拓扑被网络拓扑锁死</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IPIP 隧道</td>\n<td>20 字节</td>\n<td>节点间 IP 可达</td>\n<td>Calico IPIP</td>\n<td>外层协议号 4，多数云安全组默认不放行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VXLAN 隧道</td>\n<td>50 字节</td>\n<td>节点间 IP 可达 + UDP 放行</td>\n<td>Flannel、Calico VXLAN、Cilium <code>tunnel</code></td>\n<td>MTU 损失、封装 CPU、源 IP 被隐藏</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>BGP 原生路由</td>\n<td>0 字节</td>\n<td>网关可编程路由</td>\n<td>Calico BGP、Cilium BGP Control Plane</td>\n<td>需运维路由协议，路由规模有上限</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>表中「封装开销」不是抽象数字——它直接吃掉 Pod 可用的 MTU，下一节展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bridge-与-veth-同节点接入与跨节点出口\">bridge 与 veth：同节点接入与跨节点出口</h2><p>最常见的 CNI 配置是 <code>bridge</code> + <code>host-local</code> + <code>portmap</code> 串联：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;cniVersion&quot;: &quot;1.1.0&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;mynet&quot;,&#10;  &quot;plugins&quot;: [&#10;    { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;bridge&quot;, &quot;bridge&quot;: &quot;cni0&quot;, &quot;isGateway&quot;: true,&#10;      &quot;ipMasq&quot;: true, &quot;mtu&quot;: 1450,&#10;      &quot;ipam&quot;: { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;host-local&quot;, &quot;ranges&quot;: [[{ &quot;subnet&quot;: &quot;10.244.1.0/24&quot; }]] } },&#10;    { &quot;type&quot;: &quot;portmap&quot;, &quot;capabilities&quot;: { &quot;portMappings&quot;: true } }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"cniVersion\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"1.1.0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"mynet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"plugins\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"bridge\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"bridge\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"cni0\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"isGateway\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ipMasq\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"mtu\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1450</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"ipam\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"host-local\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"ranges\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [[{ </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"subnet\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"10.244.1.0/24\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }]] } },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"portmap\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"capabilities\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"portMappings\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> } }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ADD</code> 时插件创建一对 veth：一端留在主机、挂到网桥 <code>cni0</code>，另一端塞进 Pod 的 netns 并改名 <code>eth0</code>。<code>isGateway: true</code> 让网桥配置该子网的网关地址，Pod 的默认路由因此指向网桥；<code>ipMasq: true</code> 插入 MASQUERADE 规则，使 Pod 访问集群外时才做 SNAT。</p>\n<p>主机侧必须打开 <code>net.ipv4.ip_forward=1</code>，网桥上通常开 <code>proxy_arp</code>，否则 Pod 的 ARP 请求出不了网桥。两个容易忽略的细节：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>mtu</code> 必须显式设置</strong>。不设时 veth 继承主机 MTU（常见 1500），但跨节点若走 VXLAN 实际可用只有 1450。结果是握手成功、小请求成功、大批量传输随机挂起——典型的 MTU 事故，不是「网络不通」而是「大包不通」。</li>\n<li><strong>网桥不提供跨节点能力</strong>。<code>bridge</code> 插件把包送到主机路由层就结束，剩下交给另一套机制。这解释了为什么 Flannel 要额外跑 <code>flanneld</code> 写路由表、Calico 要安装 BGP daemon。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>同节点两 Pod 通信因此几乎零成本：veth → 网桥 → veth，两次内存内转发，不涉及封装。这也是亲和性调度把强通信 Pod 拉到同节点的物理依据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"overlay-封装-vxlan-与-ipip-的开销与-mtu-预算\">overlay 封装：VXLAN 与 IPIP 的开销与 MTU 预算</h2><p>overlay 解决的核心矛盾是：Pod 的 IP 平面与节点 IP 平面无关，而 underlay 只认节点 IP。做法是把 Pod 的原始包当作载荷，外再套一层节点到节点的包头。<strong>VXLAN</strong>（RFC 7348，<code>rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc7348</code>）是 L2 over L3，把二层帧装进 UDP；<strong>IPIP</strong>（RFC 2003，<code>rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2003</code>）三层套三层，没有 UDP 与 VXLAN 头：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>V</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>14</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>U</mi><mi>D</mi><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>V</mi><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>8</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>50</mn><mtext> 字节</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{VXLAN} = E_{outer}(14) + IP_{outer}(20) + UDP(8) + VXLAN(8) = 50\\ \\text{字节}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">50</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>I</mi><mi>P</mi><mi>I</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>14</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mi>I</mi><msub><mi>P</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi></mrow></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>20</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>34</mn><mtext> 字节（新增 IP 头 20 字节）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_{IPIP} = E_{outer}(14) + IP_{outer}(20) = 34\\ \\text{字节（新增 IP 头 20 字节）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">14</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1389em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">34</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节（新增</span><span class=\"mord\"> IP </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">头</span><span class=\"mord\"> 20 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">字节）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>于是 Pod 可用 MTU 是一个简单的减法：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MTU_{pod} = MTU_{underlay} - H_{encap}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。对标准 1500 字节 underlay：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>模式</th>\n<th>封装开销</th>\n<th>Pod 默认 MTU</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>host-gw / BGP 原生路由</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>1500</td>\n<td>直通 underlay MTU</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IPIP（Calico 默认值）</td>\n<td>20</td>\n<td>1480</td>\n<td>外层协议号 4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VXLAN（Calico / Flannel / Cilium 默认）</td>\n<td>50</td>\n<td>1450</td>\n<td>外层 UDP：Calico 4789、Cilium <code>tunnel</code> 8472</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>AWS VPC ENI 模式</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>9001</td>\n<td>直通 VPC jumbo frame，无隧道</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>两个实践要点。第一，<strong>端口与协议要被放行</strong>：VXLAN 需节点间 UDP 4789（Calico）或 8472（Cilium）双向可达，IPIP 的外层协议号是 4——很多云安全组默认模板只放行 TCP/UDP/ICMP，IPIP 会被静默丢弃，表现为「Ping 正常、Pod 到 Pod 不通」。第二，<strong>跨 AZ 的 underlay 常是 1500</strong>，若机房内部调到 9000 而跨 AZ 保持 1500，同一集群会出现混合 MTU。</p>\n<p>代价不止 MTU。封装意味着每包多一次拷贝与一次隧道查找，10/25 Gbps 网卡上 PPS 开销先于带宽成为瓶颈——这是 Cilium 与 Calico 都提供原生路由模式的直接动因。此外 overlay 把<strong>源 Pod IP 藏进内层</strong>：节点上抓包只能看到节点 IP 之间的 UDP 4789 流量，安全组、NACL 与网络审计都看不到真实 Pod 身份，这层隐藏要在设计阶段就纳入考量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bgp-原生路由-取消封装后的路由规模问题\">BGP 原生路由：取消封装后的路由规模问题</h2><p>原生路由（native routing）的思路是：让 underlay 直接知道每个 Pod CIDR 在哪里。Calico 与 Cilium 都通过 BGP 把本节点的 Pod CIDR 宣告出去，其他节点据此建路由表项，包以原始 IP 直接转发，零封装。Cilium 自 1.14（2023-09）起内置 BGP Control Plane（基于 GoBGP），可替代早期依赖 <code>bird</code> 外挂 daemon 的做法。代价从「封装开销」转移到「路由运维」与「路由规模」：<strong>全网状（full mesh）BGP 的会话数是节点数的平方级</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>m</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">S_{fullmesh} = \\frac{N(N-1)}{2}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0576em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">m</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">es</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">h</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.113em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.427em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>100 个节点就是 4950 条 BGP 会话。标准解法是<strong>路由反射器</strong>（Route Reflection，RFC 4456，<code>rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4456</code>）：选出少数节点或外部路由器作 RR，普通节点只与 RR 建会话，会话数降回 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；Cilium BGP Control Plane 与 Calico 都支持配置 RR 与 <code>RouteReflectorClusterID</code>。</p>\n<p>另一个规模化解法是把 BGP 会话收敛到<strong>少数边界节点或 ToR 交换机</strong>，Pod 路由只在机架内宣告；这在自建数据中心更常见，云上通常不给这个自由度。</p>\n<p>还有两个物理约束必须提前确认：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Pod CIDR 必须真能被路由</strong>。原生路由要求节点能收到指向 <code>10.244.x.0/24</code> 的下一跳，即 underlay 网关/云 VPC 路由表得允许这些网段。AWS 与阿里云 VPC 路由表都有<strong>条目数与网段长度限制</strong>，Pod CIDR 通常不在允许范围，除非用 VPC 对等连接 + 自建路由器，或改用 Cilium ENI 模式。</li>\n<li><strong>ECMP 才能拿到负载均衡</strong>。等价多路径让流量在多个链路间散列，依赖内核 <code>fib_multipath_hash_policy</code> 与协议的多路径能力；否则到某 Pod CIDR 的流量只走一条路径，形成热点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>零封装的收益是实打实的：Pod 可用 MTU 等于 underlay MTU（云上常是 9001），无隧道查找开销，抓包能看到真实 Pod IP，网络策略可直接基于 Pod IP 表达。对延迟敏感的跨 region 电商流量（支付回调、库存扣减），省下的封装与更低 PPS 开销可测量。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选型决策-从集群规模-mtu-与合规边界出发\">选型决策：从集群规模、MTU 与合规边界出发</h2><p>把上面三节收敛成一条判断链。起点不是「哪种更先进」，而是「underlay 给了什么能力」。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;节点是否在同一 L2 网段&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| B[&quot;host-gw / 无封装&lt;br/&gt;最简、MTU 1500&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt;|&quot;否(跨子网/跨 AZ/跨 region)&quot;| C{&quot;Pod CIDR 能否被 underlay 路由&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;能,且有可编程网关或 RR&quot;| D[&quot;BGP 原生路由&lt;br/&gt;零封装 + ECMP&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;不能,或运维成本过高&quot;| E{&quot;云厂商是否提供 ENI/IPAM 直通&quot;}&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;是(AWS VPC CNI / 阿里云 Terway 等)&quot;| F[&quot;ENI 模式&lt;br/&gt;Pod 用 VPC 真实 IP,无隧道&quot;]&#10;    E --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| G[&quot;overlay 隧道&lt;br/&gt;VXLAN(优先)或 IPIP&quot;]&#10;    G --&gt; H[&quot;显式设置 Pod MTU&lt;br/&gt;VXLAN 1450 / IPIP 1480&quot;]&#10;    H --&gt; I[&quot;把真实源 IP 可见性&lt;br/&gt;作为独立需求单独解决&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"节点是否在同一 L2 网段\"] --&gt;|\"是\"| B[\"host-gw / 无封装&lt;br/&gt;最简、MTU 1500\"]\n    A --&gt;|\"否(跨子网/跨 AZ/跨 region)\"| C{\"Pod CIDR 能否被 underlay 路由\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"能,且有可编程网关或 RR\"| D[\"BGP 原生路由&lt;br/&gt;零封装 + ECMP\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"不能,或运维成本过高\"| E{\"云厂商是否提供 ENI/IPAM 直通\"}\n    E --&gt;|\"是(AWS VPC CNI / 阿里云 Terway 等)\"| F[\"ENI 模式&lt;br/&gt;Pod 用 VPC 真实 IP,无隧道\"]\n    E --&gt;|\"否\"| G[\"overlay 隧道&lt;br/&gt;VXLAN(优先)或 IPIP\"]\n    G --&gt; H[\"显式设置 Pod MTU&lt;br/&gt;VXLAN 1450 / IPIP 1480\"]\n    H --&gt; I[\"把真实源 IP 可见性&lt;br/&gt;作为独立需求单独解决\"]</pre><p>几个具体的取舍判断：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>节点数十以内且同机房</strong>：host-gw 或纯 L2 直连复杂度最低，MTU 无损，排查最简单，不要为「高级」引入 BGP。</li>\n<li><strong>跨 AZ/region、规模中等</strong>：云 VPC 路由表通常不允许宣告 Pod CIDR，overlay 是默认可行解。选 VXLAN 而非 IPIP：IPIP 外层协议号常被云网络策略拦掉，UDP 4789 更容易放行。</li>\n<li><strong>大规模、有可编程网络</strong>：BGP + 路由反射器是唯一能同时满足零封装与可扩展性的方案，但 BGP 会话运维（RR 部署、宣告范围、收敛与抖动）要当独立子系统维护。</li>\n<li><strong>云托管优先</strong>：AWS VPC CNI、阿里云 Terway 把 Pod IP 取成 VPC 真实 IP，天然零封装、MTU 直通 jumbo、安全组可见 Pod IP；代价是 IP 数受实例 ENI 配额限制且强绑定云厂商。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>最后两条容易漏掉的维度。其一是<strong>可观测性</strong>：overlay 下任何依赖「Pod IP 出现在包头」的抓包、流日志、防火墙规则都会失效，必须改由 eBPF 层（如 Cilium Hubble）观测。其二是<strong>合规审计</strong>：跨境业务常有「日志须记录真实来源」要求，若审计口径落在 IP 上，overlay 让节点成为唯一网络身份，来源归属须另用机制补齐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CNI 是接口规范，不约束封装与路由；插件的实质决策在<strong>跨节点转发</strong>，<code>bridge</code> 只解决同节点接入。</li>\n<li>三种跨节点路径：零封装的 L2 直连/BGP 原生路由、20 字节 IPIP、50 字节 VXLAN。封装开销直接换算成 MTU 损失：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>d</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><mi>T</mi><msub><mi>U</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mrow><mi>e</mi><mi>n</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>p</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">MTU_{pod} = MTU_{underlay} - H_{encap}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">U</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">c</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">p</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><code>mtu</code> 必须显式配置且按集群最小 underlay 值计算，否则故障形态是「小包通、大包随机挂」，极易误判为应用问题。</li>\n<li>VXLAN 需放行 UDP 4789/8472，IPIP 需放行外层协议号 4；后者常被云安全组静默丢弃，是 overlay 落地最常见的障碍。</li>\n<li>BGP 原生路由把成本从封装转移到路由规模：全网状会话数为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N(N-1)/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span>，规模化须引入路由反射器（RFC 4456），并确认 Pod CIDR 真能被 underlay 路由。</li>\n<li>overlay 隐藏真实 Pod IP，云安全组、NACL 与基于 IP 的审计都会失效；有来源审计要求的环境须把这层可见性当独立需求设计。</li>\n<li>选型起点始终是 underlay 能力（是否同 L2、能否路由 Pod CIDR、是否提供 ENI 直通），其次才是性能偏好。NetworkPolicy 落地见 <a href=\"../networkpolicy-ebpf-enforcement/\">NetworkPolicy 与 eBPF 强制</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"CNI 插件与数据面实现：bridge/overlay(VXLAN/IPIP)/BGP 与路由模式选型","id":"cni-插件与数据面实现-bridge-overlay-vxlan-ipip-bgp-与路由模式选型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：CNI 契约只定接口，数据面模式定转发","id":"核心概念-cni-契约只定接口-数据面模式定转发"},{"level":2,"text":"bridge 与 veth：同节点接入与跨节点出口","id":"bridge-与-veth-同节点接入与跨节点出口"},{"level":2,"text":"overlay 封装：VXLAN 与 IPIP 的开销与 MTU 预算","id":"overlay-封装-vxlan-与-ipip-的开销与-mtu-预算"},{"level":2,"text":"BGP 原生路由：取消封装后的路由规模问题","id":"bgp-原生路由-取消封装后的路由规模问题"},{"level":2,"text":"选型决策：从集群规模、MTU 与合规边界出发","id":"选型决策-从集群规模-mtu-与合规边界出发"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Pod 网络模型与 CNI 规范：网络命名空间、veth 与插件契约","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-cni-cilium-ebpf-dataplane-service-routing/pod-network-cni-model/pod-network-model-cni-spec"},"next":{"title":"IPAM 地址分配、MTU/分片与 Pod 网络故障排查","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-cni-cilium-ebpf-dataplane-service-routing/pod-network-cni-model/ipam-mtu-troubleshooting"}}